    "title": "Leo and the Shadow Thief",
    "description": "Leo is a six-and-a-half-year-old boy with a brilliant mind and a big problem: he hates his shadow! It follows him everywhere and never says thank you. But one morning, his shadow completely disappears! Vanished, stolen by a mysterious Shadow Thief lurking in outer space. Without hesitation, Leo climbs into his Cardboard-Rocket-3000 and blasts off toward the stars to get it back. A heartwarming story of adventure, empathy, and friendship for children ages 4 to 8.",
