    "description": "One cold winter night, Leo looks out his window and notices something terrible: the stars are disappearing one by one! The night sky has turned pitch black. Leo upgrades his Cardboard Rocket into the Mk II and flies off to a frozen ice planet, where he meets a giant, shivering light-blue Yeti who took the stars just to stay warm...",
